    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One More Plate</i> is a physics-based quirky funny game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you\u2019ll serve food on anything but proper plates\u2014from sausages to Master Swords or even game controllers!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels and plates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and two-player co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable appearance and outfits (in development)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games corresponding to each plate (in development)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party mode and versus mode (in development) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a wacky plate idea? Leave us a message and let us know what you\u2019d add to the lineup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305190/extras/0d583d1a2af830b5dc9f6c9b48217df4.avif?t=1754027834\" data-has-big width=800 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
